//RS /// c109 Phase 19: a GENERIC STRUCT free function — a turbofish struct literal
//RS /// (`__jet_Pair::<i64> { … }`), a `Type::Apply` param/return, a `[T]`-field builtin
//RS /// (`copy.items.push(item)`), and the generic-struct value clone (`copy := s`).
